  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Student Life and Parent Life Video Production</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The issue of deviance, discrimination, violence and aggression in schools in Dominica and in the wider society necessitates concerted actions at various levels to reverse prevailing trends before they escalate. In this regard, a video series called Student Life and an interrelated series called Parent Life will be filmed. The intended video production aims, with the use of drama, (1) to attract the attention of children, their parents and other adults (2) to cause them to reflect on their actions and the contribution young people and adults could make in assisting themselves (3) to encourage adults in assisting young people to better deal with behavioral issues.</narrative>
  </description>
